OL,3,GNEWSAI died twice, says man saved by
OL,4,Aoff-duty police officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who collapsed and suffered a
OL,7,Fcardiac arrest in a shop said his son
OL,8,Fcould have lost his dad at the age of
OL,9,F12 if a "hero" off-duty police sergeant
OL,10,Fhad not saved him.
OL,12,FJames Ashley, 52, from Merthyr Tydfil,
OL,13,Fhad just finished parkrun and was
OL,14,Fshopping in Cwmbran when he was hit by
OL,15,Fa "wave of dizziness" and went to the
OL,16,Ffloor on 4 April.
OL,18,FLuckily for him Adam Hollings, a
OL,19,Fsergeant with Gwent Police, was nearby
OL,20,Fand immediately started work to perform
OL,21,FCPR and resuscitate him.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
