OL,3,GNEWSAI died twice, says man saved by
OL,4,Aoff-duty police officer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I clinically died twice but by the
OL,7,Ftime the paramedics got there, I was
OL,8,Fsitting up talking, and that's the
OL,9,Fdifference Adam made," said Ashley.
